Dialogue: 1,0:22:47.53,0:22:49.61,ED - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)\blur4}依旧不愿被人窥探
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.61,0:22:52.71,ED - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)\blur4}覆い隠した
Dialogue: 1,0:22:49.61,0:22:52.71,ED - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)\blur4}于是层层掩藏
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.71,0:22:54.72,ED - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)\blur4}なんでも良いけれど
Dialogue: 1,0:22:52.71,0:22:54.72,ED - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)\blur4}即便说着不在意
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.72,0:22:57.58,ED - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)\blur4}一枚隔てたら
Dialogue: 1,0:22:54.72,0:22:57.58,ED - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)\blur4}但若是咫尺相隔
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.58,0:23:01.90,ED - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)\blur4}本音がきけるから
Dialogue: 1,0:22:57.58,0:23:01.90,ED - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)\blur4}就能听到我的心曲
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.90,0:23:04.59,ED - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)\blur4}フィクション／ノンフィクション
Dialogue: 1,0:23:01.90,0:23:04.59,ED - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)\blur4}虚构与真实
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.59,0:23:07.12,ED - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)\blur4}事実も中にはあるかもしれない？
Dialogue: 1,0:23:04.59,0:23:07.12,ED - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)\blur4}或许谎言中夹杂着几分真心？
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.12,0:23:09.76,ED - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)\blur4}フィクション／ノンフィクション
Dialogue: 1,0:23:07.12,0:23:09.76,ED - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)\blur4}虚构与真实
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.76,0:23:12.33,ED - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)\blur4}嘘もほんとも全部
Dialogue: 1,0:23:09.76,0:23:12.33,ED - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)\blur4}真亦假时假亦真
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.33,0:23:13.72,ED - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)\blur4}見つけたい
Dialogue: 1,0:23:12.33,0:23:13.72,ED - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)\blur4}四处寻觅着
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.72,0:23:17.56,ED - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)\blur4}まだ知らない　君を探してる
Dialogue: 1,0:23:13.72,0:23:17.56,ED - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)\blur4}那个陌生的你
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.56,0:23:20.10,ED - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)\blur4}話したい　ことばかりで
Dialogue: 1,0:23:17.56,0:23:20.10,ED - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)\blur4}怀揣满腔情思
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.10,0:23:22.72,ED - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)\blur4}時間が過ぎてゆく
Dialogue: 1,0:23:20.10,0:23:22.72,ED - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)\blur4}时光缓缓流逝
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.72,0:23:25.27,ED - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)\blur4}横たわる　この世界も
Dialogue: 1,0:23:22.72,0:23:25.27,ED - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)\blur4}眼前的这片天地
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.27,0:23:27.85,ED - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)\blur4}気づけば　暮れている
Dialogue: 1,0:23:25.27,0:23:27.85,ED - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)\blur4}回过神时已是夕阳残照
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.85,0:23:29.85,ED - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)\blur4}明日も　ここで
Dialogue: 1,0:23:27.85,0:23:29.85,ED - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)\blur4}愿明天在此地
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.85,0:23:32.35,ED - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)\blur4}同じ場所で会えるように
Dialogue: 1,0:23:29.85,0:23:32.35,ED - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)\blur4}再度与你相会
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.14,0:23:34.36,ED - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)\blur4}Goodbye
Dialogue: 1,0:23:33.14,0:23:34.36,ED - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)\blur4}回见
